.PP
When the exception happens，use getLastErrMsg() to get the error message or use
getLastError() to get the error code.
For more details, refer to Troubleshooting.
.SH VERSION
.PP
v5.0 and above
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Reelect in the server group where the current STP node is located, and specify
the election timeout period as 60s.
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
> var stp = new Stp()
> stp.reelect({Seconds: 60})
\f[]
.fi
